<title>HONG KONG: Everbright-IHD shares soar on bank news.</title>
<headline>Everbright-IHD shares soar on bank news.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd leaped to new highs in early Wednesday trade, following confirmation and the price of its acquisition of a stake in Everbright Bank of China, brokers said.</p>
<p>The share jumped to an all-time high of HK$19.10 from its HK$12.60 close on June 12.</p>
<p>The share then eased to trade HK$4.70 higher at HK$17.30. Turnover in the first hour of trade was more than 41 million shares worth HK$742 million.</p>
</text>
